---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for the WRECKON website.">
  <Container class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <div class="rounded-sm border border-amber-400 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm text-amber-700">
        <strong>Draft — not legally reviewed.</strong> This placeholder must be reviewed by the business
        (and ideally a legal advisor) before the site goes live. It does not yet reflect WRECKON's actual
        data handling practices.
      </div>

      <h1 class="mt-8 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="content mt-6">
        <p>This policy will explain what personal information WRECKON collects (for example, through
          enquiry and quote forms), how it is used, how it is stored, and who it may be shared with
          (including any future business systems such as Hazarlink).</p>
        <p>It will also explain how visitors can access, correct or request deletion of their information,
          and how to contact WRECKON with privacy questions.</p>
        <p>Final wording should align with the Australian Privacy Principles under the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth)
          and be confirmed with the business before publishing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
